  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-024",
    "title": "沈砚秋的证词"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_125",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "掌门没有打开，先将信交给了沈砚秋。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯照着来时的路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4023,
          "end": 4023
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离沿雪线返回旧驿道，叶观澜走在最后。他们没有回到无灯镇，而是在一处塌毁的石桥下停住。灯光在雪地上铺开一条青白色的线，线的尽头指向北侧山谷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4025,
          "end": 4025
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4027,
          "end": 4027
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看着山谷：“顾氏旧库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4029,
          "end": 4029
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你以前来过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4031,
          "end": 4031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“小时候来过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4033,
          "end": 4033
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得路吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4035,
          "end": 4035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得入口，不记得里面。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4037,
          "end": 4037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旁边笑了一声：“借火的代价来得很快。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4039,
          "end": 4039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有理会。他掌心残印的空白比昨夜更大，像有人从里面挖走了一小块。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4041,
          "end": 4041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山谷入口立着两根断柱。柱上顾氏旧印已经被刮去，只留一圈浅痕。顾长离取出铜针，插入右侧柱脚的孔洞，石壁随即向内凹陷，露出一道窄门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4043,
          "end": 4043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门后是顾氏旧库。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4045,
          "end": 4045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "库房里没有灵石和法器，只有一排排木匣。每只木匣都贴着账页，账页上记录灯具、铜丝和封存材料的去向。最靠里的木匣被铁链锁住，锁面刻着“归墟灵城”五字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4047,
          "end": 4047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到锁前，手指悬在刻痕上方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4049,
          "end": 4049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你有钥匙？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4051,
          "end": 4051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4053,
          "end": 4053
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那怎么开？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4055,
          "end": 4055
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“用顾氏的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4057,
          "end": 4057
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她从袖中取出那枚旧印，按在锁面。铁链没有断，锁芯却发出咔的一声。门内响起纸张翻动的声音，像有人在黑暗里等待核对账目。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4059,
          "end": 4059
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离推开木匣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4061,
          "end": 4061
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "里面只有一卷薄册和一枚干涸的墨印。薄册封面写着：封存工程经手人债契。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4063,
          "end": 4063
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她翻开第一页，第一行便是自己的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4065,
          "end": 4065
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离，顾氏旁支第七代，继承未偿债一笔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4067,
          "end": 4067
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“你出生之后就有债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4069,
          "end": 4069
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏的债不按出生算，按印记算。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4071,
          "end": 4071
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是什么债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4073,
          "end": 4073
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离翻到下一页。页上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4075,
          "end": 4075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“以一名后代的修行根基，偿还一盏未归之灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4077,
          "end": 4077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的手指停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4079,
          "end": 4079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你不能突破筑基？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4081,
          "end": 4081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是不能，是每突破一层，债契便会从家族记忆里取走一个名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4083,
          "end": 4083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走近查看：“这不是债契，是封存术的附录。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4085,
          "end": 4085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏把它叫债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4087,
          "end": 4087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为债比术更容易让人服从。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4089,
          "end": 4089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把薄册翻到最后。最后一页有三处手印：顾氏、玄霄宗、归墟盟。三方印记下方写着同一句话：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4091,
          "end": 4091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“经手人不得拒绝第二次点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4093,
          "end": 4093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起顾长离叔父将第二盏灯送回无灯镇的影像。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4095,
          "end": 4095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他拒绝过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4097,
          "end": 4097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才把债传给后代。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4099,
          "end": 4099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你家族知道他还活着吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4101,
          "end": 4101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们说他死在灵脉城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4103,
          "end": 4103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离合上薄册，神情平静得近乎冷漠。她将旧印收回袖中，却没有把薄册放下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4105,
          "end": 4105
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要带走它？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4107,
          "end": 4107
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是我唯一能证明顾氏说谎的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4109,
          "end": 4109
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "库房深处忽然传来一阵铜铃声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4111,
          "end": 4111
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是外面的风铃，而是木匣内部的铃。最靠墙的一只小匣自行打开，露出一张被折成四层的旧纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4113,
          "end": 4113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离展开纸张。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4115,
          "end": 4115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上画着三盏灯和一座城门。第一盏灯旁写着“玄霄”，第二盏灯旁写着“顾氏”，第三盏灯旁却没有名字，只有一道空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4117,
          "end": 4117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城门下方标着一行日期：冬至前七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4119,
          "end": 4119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯没有经手人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4121,
          "end": 4121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“或者经手人的名字已经被拿走。”叶观澜答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4123,
          "end": 4123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸张背面还有一行小字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4125,
          "end": 4125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“等找到第三盏灯，或许能知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4203,
          "end": 4203
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石阶尽头的青灯忽然转向，照出雪原深处一扇半开的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4205,
          "end": 4205
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门后传来风雪声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4207,
          "end": 4207
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "极寒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4209,
          "end": 4209
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾氏旧债的债主找上门来，是一名在城门卖糖人的老人。老人拿出一枚顾家旧币，说当年顾氏借走全城灯油，承诺以三代人的寿数偿还。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4211,
          "end": 4211
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临沿着城墙走了一圈，逐户询问灯火由谁掌管。有人说是祖上传下来的规矩，有人说只是为了照亮回家的路，也有人承认自己害怕黑暗才点灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4213,
          "end": 4213
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他让灯光继续照着门口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4215,
          "end": 4215
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-098",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4217,
          "end": 4217
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临在街巷中继续查访，先听老人讲旧事，再听孩子说眼前的变化。他把每一份证词写下，却不急着判断真假。有人认为灯应由宗门掌管，有人认为城里每个人都有守灯的资格，也有人只想让家人平安回家。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-099",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4219,
          "end": 4219
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "留给后人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4221,
          "end": 4221
        }
      }
    ],
